  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "31435388",
      "title": "Allowing Map Interaction & Adding Markers",
      "lectureOrder": 205,
      "videoOrder": 199,
      "sourceHash": "85eb1894b0a5ac1b6faaaab8c857da226dafb8a37ffc085208a3ec82ae2d8b2c",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.08,
          "end": 4.5,
          "en": "So we are able to display a Map now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.5,
          "end": 6.95,
          "en": "the next step is to make it pressable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.95,
          "end": 11.35,
          "en": "to detect when the user selects a place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.35,
          "end": 13.39,
          "en": "And this again is quite simple",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.39,
          "end": 16.8,
          "en": "because MapView has a on press prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.8,
          "end": 19.85,
          "en": "which will be triggered whenever the Map is pressed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.85,
          "end": 22.36,
          "en": "and it will give us an object with information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.36,
          "end": 26.35,
          "en": "about the place on the Map, where the press occurred.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.35,
          "end": 28.22,
          "en": "So it will give us the coordinates",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.22,
          "end": 30.67,
          "en": "that were selected by the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.67,
          "end": 33.48,
          "en": "That will be very convenient, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.48,
          "end": 36.23,
          "en": "So therefore, all we have to do here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.23,
          "end": 40.033,
          "en": "is add another function to our Map Component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41,
          "end": 45.09,
          "en": "the selectLocationHandler function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.66,
          "end": 49.03,
          "en": "which will get an event object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.03,
          "end": 51.6,
          "en": "And it's this selectLocationHandler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.6,
          "end": 53.39,
          "en": "which we connect to onPress.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.67,
          "end": 58.74,
          "en": "Now in here, we can then get the selected latitude",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.74,
          "end": 60.57,
          "en": "and store it in a constant",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.57,
          "end": 65.102,
          "en": "by diving into event.nativeEvent, as it turns out,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.102,
          "end": 68.63,
          "en": ".coordinate.latitude.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.63,
          "end": 71.86,
          "en": "And we could of course, console.log the event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.86,
          "end": 75.24,
          "en": "to the console here to learn its structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 75.24,
          "end": 76.133,
          "en": "if we wanted to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.3,
          "end": 79.74,
          "en": "Now this is the structure it will have though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.74,
          "end": 83.12,
          "en": "We will be able to get the selected latitude like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.12,
          "end": 86.44,
          "en": "and we can use the same approach for getting the longitude,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.44,
          "end": 89.85,
          "en": "accessing the Native Event, the coordinate,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.85,
          "end": 92.463,
          "en": "and then there, the longitude like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.32,
          "end": 96.6,
          "en": "With that, we got these two key pieces of information.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 96.6,
          "end": 100.50999999999999,
          "en": "And as our next step, we can now use that information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 100.50999999999999,
          "end": 102.34,
          "en": "to add a Marker to the Map",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 102.34,
          "end": 105.2,
          "en": "to show the user that we registered the tap",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.2,
          "end": 107.68299999999999,
          "en": "and that we registered a certain location.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.07,
          "end": 111.27000000000001,
          "en": "For that, we wanna add some State",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 111.27000000000001,
          "end": 114.17,
          "en": "to this Map Screen Component as a first step",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.17,
          "end": 116.233,
          "en": "imported from React, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.22,
          "end": 122.22,
          "en": "The State which we have here is the selectedLocation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 122.85,
          "end": 127.5,
          "en": "with the setSelectedLocation, State Updating function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 127.5,
          "end": 130.657,
          "en": "And then here, we can call setSelectedLocation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 131.743,
          "end": 136.3,
          "en": "and set this equal to an object where we store the latitude",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 136.3,
          "end": 139.47,
          "en": "and set this equal to this latitude",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 139.47,
          "end": 141.97,
          "en": "and store our lng property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 141.97,
          "end": 145.11,
          "en": "which is equal to this lng property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.11,
          "end": 147.72,
          "en": "And I'm doing this because now the Component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 147.72,
          "end": 151.8,
          "en": "will be re-evaluated after selecting a location.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 151.8,
          "end": 155.03,
          "en": "And we can use this State to add a Marker now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 155.03,
          "end": 157.12,
          "en": "with help of this Marker Component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 157.12,
          "end": 158.653,
          "en": "which we're already importing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 159.57,
          "end": 164.02,
          "en": "This can be rendered inside of our MapView like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 164.02,
          "end": 169.02,
          "en": "And Marker just wants to get a coordinate prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 169.17000000000002,
          "end": 172.1,
          "en": "which is an object where coordinates",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 172.1,
          "end": 173.973,
          "en": "are set up in a certain way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 174.89,
          "end": 176.88,
          "en": "To be precise, it's a object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 176.88,
          "end": 179.27,
          "en": "where we should have a latitude property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 179.27,
          "end": 182.703,
          "en": "which we can now set equal to our selectedLocation.lat.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 185.72,
          "end": 188.69,
          "en": "So our State Object has a lat property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 188.69,
          "end": 190.74,
          "en": "I'm accessing that here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 190.74,
          "end": 194.4,
          "en": "And we set a longitude property written like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 194.4,
          "end": 196.87,
          "en": "in this object, which we pass to coordinate,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 196.87,
          "end": 200.363,
          "en": "which can be set equal to selectedLocation.lng.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 201.3,
          "end": 204.41,
          "en": "Alternatively, we could have chosen latitude and longitude",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 204.41,
          "end": 206.87,
          "en": "as property names in our State Object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 206.87,
          "end": 209.23,
          "en": "and then use the State Object itself here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 209.23,
          "end": 211.67000000000002,
          "en": "as a value for coordinate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 211.67000000000002,
          "end": 213.47,
          "en": "here, I'm doing it like this though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 214.6,
          "end": 216.89,
          "en": "We can also give this Marker a title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 216.89,
          "end": 220.113,
          "en": "and here I will give it a title of Picked Location.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 222.61,
          "end": 226.653,
          "en": "With all that done, we should be able to reload this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 227.81,
          "end": 231.99,
          "en": "open the Map again, and then getting an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 231.99,
          "end": 235.703,
          "en": "that we can't access selectedLocation.lat.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 237.04,
          "end": 239.65,
          "en": "The reason for this is, of course, that I'm always trying",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 239.65,
          "end": 241.07,
          "en": "to render this Marker",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 241.07,
          "end": 243.6,
          "en": "even if we have no selected location yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 243.6,
          "end": 246.04,
          "en": "which, of course, means our State is undefined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 246.04,
          "end": 249.123,
          "en": "and trying to access lat or lng will fail.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 250.15,
          "end": 253.17,
          "en": "We should instead render this Marker conditionally,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 253.17,
          "end": 256.3,
          "en": "by checking if we have a selected location,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 256.3,
          "end": 258.25,
          "en": "if that is truthy,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 258.25,
          "end": 261.033,
          "en": "and only rendering the Marker if that is the case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 261.9,
          "end": 265.95,
          "en": "Now with that, if we save this and we reload this here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 265.95,
          "end": 269.42,
          "en": "it should work, and we should be able to click this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 269.42,
          "end": 272.2,
          "en": "open the Map, and if I tap here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 272.2,
          "end": 275.423,
          "en": "a Marker gets added at the place where I tapped.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 276.69,
          "end": 281.69,
          "en": "So that is working, and this will also work on Android.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 281.69,
          "end": 284.78,
          "en": "Here, I can also tap to add a Marker",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 284.78,
          "end": 287.43,
          "en": "in the place where I did tap.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 287.43,
          "end": 290.75,
          "en": "So now with that, we are able to choose a location",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 290.75,
          "end": 294.48,
          "en": "and we get some visual feedback here on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 294.48,
          "end": 296.56,
          "en": "Now, I want to add a header icon",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 296.56,
          "end": 300.42,
          "en": "that allows me to save this chosen location,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 300.42,
          "end": 303.86,
          "en": "so that the location is then passed back to this screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 303.86,
          "end": 305.52,
          "en": "and on this screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 305.52,
          "end": 308.083,
          "en": "we can then use it to show a preview you again.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
